   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1761231600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The errors are underlined as the learner types; the hover gives the message. Run doesn't start: it lists them in the console.\nA click on a place in the console, or on \"2 errors\" in the status bar, puts the cursor on it. The map stays as it starts.",
